# Secrets Template
# Copy this file to .secrets/ and fill in your actual API keys
# DO NOT commit the actual .secrets/ directory to version control

# Hugging Face Hub Token
# Get your token from: https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens
# Place it in: .secrets/hf_token
# Example: hf_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# Weights & Biases API Key
# Get your key from: https://wandb.ai/settings
# Place it in: .secrets/wandb_key
# Example: xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# Usage:
# 1. Create .secrets directory: mkdir -p .secrets
# 2. Copy this template: cp .secrets.template .secrets/README.md
# 3. Create your token files:
#    echo "your_hf_token_here" > .secrets/hf_token
#    echo "your_wandb_key_here" > .secrets/wandb_key
# 4. Set proper permissions: chmod 600 .secrets/*
